1
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:11,560
Dad.

2
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,519
Father.

3
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,400
Why don't we

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,280
take a photo?

5
00:00:24,559 --> 00:00:25,640
It's your birthday.

6
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:26,519
Look,

7
00:00:26,519 --> 00:00:28,879
Big and Second Brother are both here.

8
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:31,920
Let's mark the occasion.

9
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:36,560
Go ahead and take it.

10
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:37,359
All right.

11
00:00:38,479 --> 00:00:38,840
Right.

12
00:00:40,359 --> 00:00:42,039
Th-then I'll take it.

13
00:00:42,039 --> 00:00:43,920
Then on three, two, one, let's toast.

14
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:49,679
Hurry up!

15
00:00:49,679 --> 00:00:50,520
Right, okay!

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:52,159
Ready!

17
00:00:53,079 --> 00:00:54,719
Three, two, one.

18
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,880
Happy birthday, Father!

19
00:00:57,399 --> 00:00:58,840
Happy birthday, Dad!

20
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,359
Hey, Third Brother.

21
00:01:11,359 --> 00:01:12,640
Hurry up and sit down once you're done.

22
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:13,799
Don't rush me.

23
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:14,719
Almost done.

24
00:01:15,439 --> 00:01:17,120
Third Brother, sit down when you're done.

25
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:19,680
I told you, don't rush me.

26
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,360
Captain Liao.

27
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,759
It's just as I suspected.

28
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:05,400
Huang Lun is the real mastermind.

29
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,840
Wu Xiang is in his hands now.

30
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,919
I'm heading there. I'll send the address.

31
00:03:10,039 --> 00:03:11,400
Make sure you stay safe.

32
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:14,039
I'll have SWAT mobilize immediately.

33
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:15,479
Protect Yang Jingya for me.

34
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:17,199
She's on the fourth floor of Central Hospital.

35
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,159
Leave it to me.

36
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,439
Brother Hao.

37
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:00,319
All right.

38
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:25,399
Cheng Hao.

39
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:27,759
Brother Wu.

40
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:57,360
Cheng Hao.

41
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,879
Brother Wu.

42
00:05:04,439 --> 00:05:05,560
Qingqing...

43
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:07,079
She made it safely, right?

44
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:08,639
Yeah.

45
00:05:09,279 --> 00:05:10,000
Yeah.

46
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:10,800
Yeah.

47
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,079
Everything's safe.

48
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,560
Safe.

49
00:05:18,519 --> 00:05:19,600
Zhao Yiyang.

50
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,439
What the hell do you want?

51
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:24,959
Are you talking to me?

52
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:26,759
The Snake King...

53
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,439
Isn't he your father?

54
00:05:31,199 --> 00:05:34,560
Brother Hao, I really underestimated you.

55
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:40,160
So what if you know?

56
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:44,959
That old bastard died over a year ago.

57
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,639
I'm the Snake King now.

58
00:05:58,439 --> 00:05:59,560
Cut the crap.

59
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,199
Where's the stuff?

60
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:03,000
Huh?

61
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:04,519
What?

62
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,600
Give you my watch?

63
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:11,439
You're Zhao Yiyang.

64
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,680
I'll tell you the truth.

65
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:18,000
I have what you want.

66
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:23,040
As for where that evidence is now...

67
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,399
Only I know.

68
00:06:27,399 --> 00:06:29,759
I've always known the Snake King had three sons.

69
00:06:30,199 --> 00:06:31,879
He never cared for the third.

70
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:33,199
Because...

71
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:35,800
The third son is a bastard.

72
00:06:37,319 --> 00:06:38,839
Seeing you now,

73
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:40,720
whether you're a bastard or not

74
00:06:41,199 --> 00:06:42,600
doesn't matter anymore.

75
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,079
What matters is,

76
00:06:45,959 --> 00:06:48,040
you're just a piece of trash.

77
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:55,199
Once you die, I'll go after your daughter.

78
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:57,519
Your daughter is named Qingqing, right?

79
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,399
Cheng Hao!

80
00:06:59,399 --> 00:07:00,600
Her name is Qingqing.

81
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:01,680
Cheng Hao!

82
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:03,839
Cheng Hao!

83
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:06,959
Wu Xiang...

84
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:10,720
This yacht is what the old man

85
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,800
gave you back then.

86
00:07:14,319 --> 00:07:15,199
Today,

87
00:07:16,079 --> 00:07:18,160
an old boat sends off an old friend.

88
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:24,879
Beg me.

89
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:32,680
Go on, save him!

90
00:07:51,279 --> 00:07:52,680
Want to see fireworks?

91
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,920
You can't touch Qingqing.

92
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,319
Don't you want the stuff?

93
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,560
I'll tell you.

94
00:08:06,439 --> 00:08:06,920
Come here.

95
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:24,920
It's the cops! Run!

96
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:36,639
Don't move!

97
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:37,559
Stay down!

98
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:39,120
Don't move!

99
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:43,320
Freeze!

100
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,360
Nobody move! Hands on your head!

101
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,440
Freeze!

102
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:51,000
Don't move!

103
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:55,360
Don't move!

104
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:56,279
Don't move!

105
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:57,399
Get down!

106
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,279
Get down! Down!

107
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:09,960
You can't get away.

108
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,200
I won't let you go find Qingqing.

109
00:09:23,399 --> 00:09:24,080
Freeze!

110
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,679
Rescue the people on the boat!

111
00:09:31,759 --> 00:09:32,159
Hurry!

112
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:04,440
Need something?

113
00:11:06,559 --> 00:11:07,279
Come in.

114
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:11,480
Chief.

115
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,360
Welcome back to the team.

116
00:11:56,159 --> 00:11:57,679
So you really are a cop.

117
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,840
I can't complain about losing to you.

118
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,440
At least I beat the guys outside.

119
00:12:06,639 --> 00:12:07,679
I'm just curious.

120
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,799
When did you start suspecting me?

121
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,080
Remember that dock deal?

122
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:16,039
That was the first time I took you there.

123
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:18,240
I drove on the way there,

124
00:12:18,679 --> 00:12:20,200
and you drove on the way back.

125
00:12:21,279 --> 00:12:23,519
But we took completely different routes.

126
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:26,120
And yet you knew the way inside out.

127
00:12:32,159 --> 00:12:33,679
You'd scouted it beforehand, right?

128
00:12:34,679 --> 00:12:36,600
And at Chen Xue's crime scene,

129
00:12:37,039 --> 00:12:38,399
that angle iron we found.

130
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,279
"What kind of junk is this?

131
00:12:42,919 --> 00:12:44,600
Who'd be sick enough to scatter these?"

132
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:46,759
Didn't you say you worked at an auto repair shop?

133
00:12:47,279 --> 00:12:49,480
Couldn't you tell it was hand-welded?

134
00:12:51,399 --> 00:12:52,440
Zhao Yiyang,

135
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,879
it showed you were deliberately

136
00:12:54,879 --> 00:12:56,240
concealing your identity.

137
00:12:58,840 --> 00:12:59,840
And when you brought Wu Xiang

138
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,360
to Zhang Maomao's place,

139
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:02,879
I spotted your vitiligo.

140
00:13:03,279 --> 00:13:04,240
That's when I suspected

141
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,159
you had ties to the Snake King.

142
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:08,080
Look into someone for me.

143
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,399
Yeah, that's him.

144
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,519
So I had my colleague

145
00:13:13,759 --> 00:13:15,080
run a background check on you.

146
00:13:15,639 --> 00:13:16,720
After running an ID comparison,

147
00:13:17,519 --> 00:13:19,240
we found out your father was Zhao Yu.

148
00:13:19,759 --> 00:13:21,440
And the vitiligo on his face

149
00:13:22,039 --> 00:13:24,480
matched our photo of the Snake King.

150
00:13:25,159 --> 00:13:26,960
Too bad for you, Zhao Yiyang.

151
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:31,120
A year and a half ago, Zhao Yu

152
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:32,960
was marked as deceased in the registry.

153
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,399
Which means you...

154
00:13:35,919 --> 00:13:37,200
are the new Snake King.

155
00:13:42,159 --> 00:13:44,000
Why give up being the Snake King

156
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,279
just to work as your lackey?

157
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,639
Because your grip on power is weak.

158
00:13:49,279 --> 00:13:51,360
You're a far cry from your old man.

159
00:13:52,519 --> 00:13:53,480
You deliberately got close to me,

160
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:55,919
then used me to get close to Wu Xiang.

161
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,399
You hijacked the shipment.

162
00:13:59,519 --> 00:14:01,159
You sent the hitmen after me.

163
00:14:01,399 --> 00:14:03,000
You killed Wang Congjun too.

164
00:14:04,039 --> 00:14:05,240
Everything you did

165
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:07,120
was to pin the blame on Wu Xiang.

166
00:14:09,879 --> 00:14:11,120
And Chen Xue's death...

167
00:14:11,639 --> 00:14:12,879
You were involved in that too, weren't you?

168
00:14:16,159 --> 00:14:17,720
A fishmonger who wanted to be an artist.

169
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:20,120
I just granted his wish.

170
00:14:33,639 --> 00:14:34,360
Such a shame.

171
00:14:37,039 --> 00:14:38,240
I was so close.

172
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,759
So close to pulling it off.

173
00:14:39,759 --> 00:14:41,279
What's a pity isn't that you failed,

174
00:14:41,559 --> 00:14:43,000
but your age.

175
00:14:44,039 --> 00:14:44,879
Zhao Yiyang,

176
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,639
you had so many choices.

177
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,480
Why did you have to choose this?

178
00:14:51,559 --> 00:14:52,799
Did I really have a choice?

179
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:56,960
From the day I was born,

180
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,840
this path was branded on my forehead.

181
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:02,639
Growing up,

182
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:07,000
no matter how hard I tried,

183
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:10,080
that old geezer, the Snake King,

184
00:15:10,519 --> 00:15:13,039
never gave me a second glance.

185
00:15:15,279 --> 00:15:16,960
And that pack of lackeys of his,

186
00:15:17,559 --> 00:15:18,759
every single one of them,

187
00:15:19,759 --> 00:15:20,960
looked down on me.

188
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:24,919
So they all deserve to die.

189
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:27,519
They deserve it!

190
00:15:29,639 --> 00:15:31,159
I just wanted to prove

191
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:34,159
that the people Snake King favored

192
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:36,720
were all complete garbage.

193
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:42,799
My plan was pretty perfect, wasn't it?

194
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:51,240
And that Wu Xiang...

195
00:15:53,039 --> 00:15:54,600
Old piece of trash.

196
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:56,320
Good-for-nothing waste of space.

197
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:59,039
I had Mr. Jing drop him hints long ago.

198
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:04,039
Surprised? Mr. Jing works for me, too.

199
00:16:05,679 --> 00:16:07,360
Xiaoxue's case

200
00:16:07,799 --> 00:16:09,080
must be investigated.

201
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:13,360
But keep a close eye on the people around you.

202
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:20,360
Hey...

203
00:16:23,559 --> 00:16:24,759
Do you think Wu Xiang

204
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:29,000
knows you're a cop?

205
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,919
It doesn't matter if Wu Xiang knows.

206
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,440
But let me tell you this:

207
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:47,600
I was a cop,

208
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,240
I'm a cop now,

209
00:16:49,639 --> 00:16:51,320
and I'll always be a cop.

210
00:17:05,079 --> 00:17:05,960
Do you think Wu Xiang

211
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:11,000
knows you're a cop?

212
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:24,160
Find a way to ask around

213
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:27,599
and see what the police actually know.

214
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:29,400
Tell me right away.

215
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:31,720
Okay.

216
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:40,279
If anything happens to me,

217
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,519
look after

218
00:17:45,279 --> 00:17:47,119
this family for me.

219
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,559
Qingqing...

220
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,519
She made it there safely, right?

221
00:17:51,119 --> 00:17:51,880
Yeah.

222
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,319
As long as I'm here,

223
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:56,359
this family stays whole.

224
00:18:25,079 --> 00:18:25,759
Auntie.

225
00:18:27,799 --> 00:18:29,079
I'm here to see Qingqing.

226
00:18:31,799 --> 00:18:32,599
Come on in.

227
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:33,920
Okay.

228
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:53,480
Uncle Tang!

229
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,160
Hey there.

230
00:18:56,519 --> 00:18:57,240
Are you drawing?

231
00:18:58,319 --> 00:18:59,960
You haven't visited in so long.

232
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:02,519
I've been a bit busy lately.

233
00:19:02,519 --> 00:19:03,480
I'm sorry.

234
00:19:03,759 --> 00:19:05,279
But I came to see you today, didn't I?

235
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,880
Where did Mom and Dad go?

236
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:10,799
I haven't seen them in days.

237
00:19:11,759 --> 00:19:12,599
Well...

238
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:16,200
Mom and Dad are always watching over you.

239
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:18,240
So you have to

240
00:19:18,759 --> 00:19:20,079
grow up healthy and happy,

241
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,759
and listen to Grandma.

242
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,119
That way,

243
00:19:23,519 --> 00:19:25,400
they'll be happy, you know?

244
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:26,359
Okay.

245
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:29,319
Look, Uncle Tang.

246
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:31,000
This is Dad.

247
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:32,519
This is Mom.

248
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:34,200
This is me.

249
00:19:34,359 --> 00:19:35,640
And this is you.

250
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:37,920
Do you like it?

251
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:42,640
It's beautiful.

252
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:46,079
When Mom and Dad come back,

253
00:19:46,599 --> 00:19:48,920
I'm going to give this drawing to them.

254
00:19:52,359 --> 00:19:53,119
Such a good kid.

255
00:20:04,599 --> 00:20:05,559
Does it look pretty?

256
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:10,599
Let Daddy put it on you.

257
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:16,920
I have all evidence on Snake King's group.

258
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:20,519
Where is this evidence now?

259
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:23,039
Only I know.

260
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,440
This is all the criminal evidence

261
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:45,720
against the Black Snake Syndicate.

262
00:20:58,839 --> 00:21:00,599
Contact the Narcotics Division immediately

263
00:21:00,599 --> 00:21:01,880
and hand over the relevant files.

264
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:10,400
Qin Xiang.

265
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:45,240
1st Brigade CID, Yujiang City Police.

266
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:47,079
Officer Tang Jinze.

267
00:22:48,119 --> 00:22:48,920
My badge number:

268
00:22:49,519 --> 00:22:51,039
021721.

269
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:02,880
Cool, right?

270
00:23:19,519 --> 00:23:21,599
A cop's wife is cooler than a Mob wife.

271
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:27,240
Remember that.

272
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,839
My name is Tang Jinze.

273
00:23:32,160 --> 00:23:33,640
I'm a police officer.

274
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:35,480
Mm-hmm.

275
00:23:36,559 --> 00:23:37,720
Jinze.

276
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:39,240
You're certainly dedicated.

277
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:46,279
Old Zhu!

278
00:23:53,559 --> 00:23:54,440
Hello, Uncle Zhu.

279
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,279
You're here!

280
00:23:56,279 --> 00:23:56,839
Hey.

281
00:23:58,440 --> 00:23:58,960
Come on in.

282
00:23:59,400 --> 00:23:59,839
Sit down.

283
00:24:00,319 --> 00:24:00,920
Yeah, take a seat.

284
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:01,640
Okay.

285
00:24:01,839 --> 00:24:03,880
Hey, boss, aren't those our noodles?

286
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:04,400
Well...

287
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:06,039
They reserved in advance.

288
00:24:06,039 --> 00:24:07,400
Yours will be right up.

289
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:08,400
Don't worry.

290
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:08,920
Thanks.

291
00:24:08,920 --> 00:24:09,680
Here we go.

292
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:10,279
Sit, sit.

293
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:11,640
Thanks, Uncle Zhu.

294
00:24:14,319 --> 00:24:14,880
Try it.

295
00:24:14,880 --> 00:24:15,440
Sure.

296
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:16,759
My cooking's pretty decent.

297
00:24:18,319 --> 00:24:18,920
Dig in.

298
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:21,279
Thank you.

299
00:24:21,519 --> 00:24:22,400
Let me tell you,

300
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,440
Old Zhu's noodle shop

301
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,519
is basically my cafeteria.

302
00:24:24,519 --> 00:24:26,039
From now on, my cafeteria is yours, too.

303
00:24:27,519 --> 00:24:28,279
That's it?

304
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:30,400
Huh?

305
00:24:30,400 --> 00:24:32,720
Well, if you want my salary card,

306
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:34,480
that depends on your performance.

307
00:24:51,559 --> 00:24:52,559
Hurry up.

308
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:55,279
Where is this?

309
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:57,279
This is my home.

310
00:25:07,319 --> 00:25:09,359
Sister!

311
00:25:09,359 --> 00:25:11,039
Slow down, careful.

312
00:25:11,039 --> 00:25:11,440
Take it easy.

313
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:13,839
You haven't visited us in so long!

314
00:25:13,839 --> 00:25:15,400
I brought you lots of snacks.

315
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,440
Who wants some?

316
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:18,160
We do!

317
00:25:18,160 --> 00:25:19,319
Go share them. Here.

318
00:25:19,319 --> 00:25:20,640
Here's more. Come on.

319
00:25:21,799 --> 00:25:22,680
Here you go.

320
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:27,319
Slow down.

321
00:25:28,279 --> 00:25:29,200
Director.

322
00:25:33,680 --> 00:25:35,440
This is the person who can protect me.

323
00:25:36,960 --> 00:25:38,839
Off you go, go play!

324
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:42,200
Did you share?

325
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:43,119
Did everyone get some?

326
00:25:43,119 --> 00:25:44,200
We did!

327
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:45,680
Hello.

328
00:25:45,880 --> 00:25:46,759
Hello.

329
00:26:03,319 --> 00:26:04,200
This is my...

330
00:26:06,519 --> 00:26:07,480
I can tell.

331
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:09,279
This is Mr. Zhong.

332
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:11,759
Zhong Zhaoqian, Yongzhong Pharmaceuticals.

333
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:14,079
He funded our orphanage.

334
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:16,519
Without him, I wouldn't be where I am today.

335
00:26:26,640 --> 00:26:28,079
This is my family home.

336
00:26:28,440 --> 00:26:30,400
If you ever mistreat me,

337
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,440
and I run away,

338
00:26:32,279 --> 00:26:33,799
do you know where to find me?

339
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:36,799
I promise you,

340
00:26:36,799 --> 00:26:38,839
the chance of you getting mad

341
00:26:38,839 --> 00:26:40,799
and coming back here alone is zero.

342
00:26:41,119 --> 00:26:42,400
Zero, zero, zero.

343
00:26:49,920 --> 00:26:51,039
How much is this one?

344
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:53,079
Ah, this one is 128,000.

345
00:26:54,839 --> 00:26:55,680
Oh.

346
00:27:01,039 --> 00:27:02,039
What are you doing?

347
00:27:02,039 --> 00:27:02,720
Hey.

348
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:05,079
Do you think this looks good?

349
00:27:05,079 --> 00:27:05,759
It looks great.

350
00:27:05,759 --> 00:27:07,319
If it looks good, let's try it.

351
00:27:07,640 --> 00:27:09,119
Let's try it on.

352
00:27:12,799 --> 00:27:13,400
Come on.

353
00:27:14,559 --> 00:27:15,279
Hey.

354
00:27:15,519 --> 00:27:16,680
How much is this?

355
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:18,559
Miss, this really suits you.

356
00:27:18,559 --> 00:27:19,359
128,000.

357
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:20,480
Try it on.

358
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:25,480
It's too cheap.

359
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:26,960
Huh?

360
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:27,759
Let's go.

361
00:27:29,640 --> 00:27:30,279
Wait...

362
00:27:37,480 --> 00:27:39,279
It is a bit cheap. Thanks.

363
00:27:48,480 --> 00:27:49,200
Here?

364
00:27:49,839 --> 00:27:50,559
Yeah.

365
00:27:51,079 --> 00:27:52,559
I've had my eye on this shop for ages.

366
00:27:52,920 --> 00:27:54,039
Just warning you,

367
00:27:54,680 --> 00:27:56,240
this takes serious stamina.

368
00:27:56,559 --> 00:27:57,559
I've got plenty of stamina.

369
00:28:51,079 --> 00:28:53,519
Aren't you an art teacher? What are you doing here?

370
00:28:55,039 --> 00:28:56,039
I'm Yang Jingya.

371
00:29:01,839 --> 00:29:04,079
Chenghao, what do you think of Xiaoya?

372
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:09,759
I grew up in an orphanage.

373
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:11,160
What's wrong with being an orphan?

374
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:12,880
Does that make orphans any different?

375
00:29:18,039 --> 00:29:20,000
You haven't told me your name yet.

376
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:25,240
Tang Chenghao.

377
00:29:27,680 --> 00:29:28,519
I like you.

378
00:29:29,519 --> 00:29:30,359
No matter who you are.

379
00:29:33,519 --> 00:29:34,559
I like you too.

380
00:30:03,759 --> 00:30:04,480
So beautiful.

381
00:30:21,480 --> 00:30:22,720
What are you doing?

382
00:30:37,079 --> 00:30:37,839
What are you looking at?

383
00:30:39,839 --> 00:30:40,599
When did you change it?

384
00:30:41,359 --> 00:30:43,119
I changed it while you were asleep.

385
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:46,200
Out of all those photos, why pick this one?

386
00:30:46,559 --> 00:30:48,160
It's just a placeholder for now.

387
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:49,319
Once we take our wedding photos,

388
00:30:49,319 --> 00:30:50,480
I'll put ours up.

389
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:52,400
When are we taking them?

390
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:54,079
As soon as we get back. I've already booked it.

391
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:18,079
Zhao Yiyang,

392
00:31:18,079 --> 00:31:20,039
I've avenged you.

393
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:25,960
A Chinese couple was inexplicably shot.

394
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:29,359
The man was critically injured and hospitalized,

395
00:31:29,359 --> 00:31:32,000
while the woman remains missing.

396
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:34,200
Police are currently hunting the killer.

397
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:36,799
Police remind tourists traveling abroad

398
00:31:36,799 --> 00:31:38,640
to take proper safety precautions

399
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:40,839
and stay alert around strangers.

400
00:31:40,839 --> 00:31:42,519
Reporting live from the scene,

401
00:31:42,519 --> 00:31:44,400
I'm field reporter Xiaomei.

402
00:32:01,960 --> 00:32:03,160
Once we take our wedding photos,

403
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:04,119
I'll put them up instead.

404
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:46,440
Dean Xu,

405
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:50,519
this is the first-gen Larburg Reagent.

406
00:32:52,799 --> 00:32:55,000
I'm leaving it in your hands.

407
00:32:56,279 --> 00:33:00,079
I hope to hear good news from you soon.

408
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:10,240
Thank you so much for your trust in us.

409
00:33:11,599 --> 00:33:13,960
If Larburg Reagent finally succeeds,

410
00:33:14,240 --> 00:33:15,559
it will allow current

411
00:33:15,960 --> 00:33:18,039
global psychiatric research

412
00:33:18,039 --> 00:33:19,279
and clinical treatments

413
00:33:19,680 --> 00:33:21,440
to take a giant leap forward.

414
00:33:22,799 --> 00:33:23,599
In that case,

415
00:33:24,160 --> 00:33:25,440
I'll take this sample

416
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,960
to the lab right away

417
00:33:27,200 --> 00:33:28,359
and have our specialists

418
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:30,079
start researching it immediately.

419
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:32,000
There's no need to rush.

420
00:33:32,720 --> 00:33:34,240
The sooner we test it,

421
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:35,440
the sooner we can

422
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:37,960
give our patients hope for a cure.

423
00:33:38,559 --> 00:33:39,160
Let me take it.

424
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:40,039
Dean Xu,

425
00:33:40,640 --> 00:33:41,880
you keep talking with Professor Yu.

426
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:45,480
For something this crucial,

427
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:47,480
I must deliver it in person.

428
00:33:50,039 --> 00:33:51,039
Professor Yu Kang,

429
00:33:51,359 --> 00:33:52,839
please wait here for a moment.

430
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:55,599
If any questions arise after the test,

431
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:58,680
our research team will need to consult you.

432
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:00,160
We'd truly value your guidance.

433
00:34:00,400 --> 00:34:01,119
Oh,

434
00:34:01,119 --> 00:34:02,359
you're far too kind.

435
00:34:02,359 --> 00:34:02,839
Well,

436
00:34:02,839 --> 00:34:04,279
I'll wait here for you to return.

437
00:34:04,279 --> 00:34:04,799
All right.

438
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:06,799
Please.

439
00:34:14,320 --> 00:34:14,880
Just a moment.
